T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Butterworth Filter Design Principles:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   A Butterworth filter is characterized by a maximally flat magnitude response in the passband) Tj
T*
(   with no ripple:) Tj
T*
(   $$|H\(j\\omega\)|^2 = \\frac{1}{1 + \(\\omega / \\omega_c\)^{2N}}$$) Tj
T*
(   where $N=4$ is the filter order and $\\omega_c = 2\\pi f_c$ is the -3 dB cutoff frequency.) Tj
T*
() Tj
