(   [Problem Statement]: Implement an automated test reporting framework combining DSP simulations, statistics, and Matplotlib figure export.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Automated Engineering Test Report Compilation Pipeline:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   ```python) Tj
T*
(   import numpy as np) Tj
T*
